TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Kirletmek istemiyorum. Kasabada{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
giymek için güzel bir sebep
çıkana kadar bekleyeceğim!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}So how do I look?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
You look great!
Um...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}¿A ti qué te parece, cielo?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
¡Te queda bien!
No sé...

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Alors, comment tu me trouves ?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
T'es magnifique.
Hum... Comment dire...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Allora, come sto?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Benissimo!
Maluccio...

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Und, wie sehe ich aus?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Du siehst toll aus!
Äh, also, äh...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}So, you don't think I should wear it?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Wear it!
I wouldn't.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Entonces, ¿debería quitármela?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
No, déjatela puesta
Sí, mejor

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Yani sence bunu giymemeli miyim?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Giy!
Ben giymezdim.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ya sé qué intentas decirme.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Que hay que ser valiente en la vida
y probar cosas nuevas.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Mi sono sporcata un po' giocando.
Dopo vedrò come mi sta.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Non voglio che si macchi!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Hey!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} This looks pretty good!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I guess I shouldn't brag,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} but I'm just
so excited!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¡Ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Pues no está mal!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡No me gusta presumir,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} pero
me queda genial!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mi sta benissimissimo!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Una signorina per bene non va
in giro a vantarsi,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ma è la verità!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}He!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sieht doch klasse aus!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ich will ja nicht angeben,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} aber ich
finde, es steht mir richtig gut!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Well,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} what do you think?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Looking good!
I'm not so sure...

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Qu'est-ce que tu en penses ?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Pas mal du tout !
Je ne sais pas trop...

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Und,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} wie findest du es?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Sieht echt gut aus!
Ach, ich weiß nicht...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Ee,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ne düşünüyorsun?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Çok iyi!
Pek emin değilim...

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Et puis zut, on ne vit qu'une fois !{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
J'ai toujours voulu porter quelque
chose de ce genre !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}I respect your opinion, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Guess I'll change back into my
old clothes.

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hee hee!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} So when should I try it on?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Show me now!
Later is fine.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Je, je!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿Me pruebo el regalo?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
¡Sí, ahora!
Mejor luego

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hi hi!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Peki ne zaman deneyeyim?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Şimdi göster!
Sonra olur.

{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Tarzımın tam potansiyeline
ulaştığımda yeniden denerim. Ama{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
şimdilik eski kıyafetlerime dönüyorum.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Um,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} what do you think?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
It looks good!
I'm not so sure...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}¿Tú qué crees, compi?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
¡Estás guapa!
No sé...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Mmmh,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} che te ne pare?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Ti sta benone!
Sei un disastro.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Ähm, hmmm,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} wie findest du's denn?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Sieht gut aus!
Nicht so toll.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Şey{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}, ne düşünüyorsun?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Güzel olmuş!
Pek emin değilim...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Comunque, adoooro il colore.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Resterò vestita così ancora per
un po'!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Pues ahora que lo dices,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} no pega
mucho con mi personalidad.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Vale, me cambio otra vez.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ora che lo dici,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} in effetti questo
non è proprio il mio stile...{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Va bene, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}farò meglio a cambiarmi!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Hımmm{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}. Bunu iyi göstermem imkânsız.{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Hadi, bir dene!
Haklısın.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Meinst du, ich soll?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Also gut, einen Versuch ist
es auf jeden Fall wert!

FR:
Qu'est-ce que t'en dis ? Ça me va ?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Et comment !
Hum... Comment dire...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Che ne dici? {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}Mi sta bene?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Sei uno schianto!
Non ci siamo...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Ee ne dersin{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}? Yakışmış mı?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Harika olmuş!
Şey...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Gracias!{{TAG:0007:0000:19000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}La verdad es que esta
ropa no está nada mal.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}¡Me gusta!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Mi sembra che abbia capito
benissimo i miei gusti.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Non lo facevo così perspicace!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hangi tarzları sevdiğimi tam
olarak biliyor gibi. Bu kadar{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
dikkatli olduğunu kim tahmin ederdi?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Seems like she really knows what I
like!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}It's almost like she's doing
research on all her neighbors.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Uaaau, conosce bene i miei gusti!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}È una grande osservatrice oppure
ha assunto un investigatore privato!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Offenbar hat sie sich ebenfalls
Gedanken deswegen gemacht...{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich sollte mich auch entschuldigen!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Ora anch'io mi sento in colpa!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Devo andare subito a scusarmi,
{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ma sono contenta che {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
mi abbia mandato un regalo!
Significa che possiamo fare pace!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Pero entiendo perfectamente
sus sentimientos!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}¡Todo por esa tontería de pelea!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Iré a pedirle perdón ahora mismito.

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Aunque es un bonito detalle!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
¡Cuánto me alegro de tener
tan buenos amigos!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Comunque, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}è stato molto carino!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Sono così feliiice di avere
degli amici tanto generosi!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Also,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} es war ja eigentlich nur ein
Missverständnis zwischen uns...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ich werde mich auch entschuldigen!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ça, c'est un cadeau fait avec le
cœur. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Je penserai à {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}
chaque fois que je le porterai !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Belli ki {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}} hediyemi seçerken {{TAG:000E:0008:01CD0600680069007300060068006500720002003000}}
gerçekten içinden gelerek uğraşmış,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} o yüzden
yine de giyeceğim.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Es war auf jeden Fall lieb gemeint,
und das ist ja das, was zählt.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich werde mich auch entschuldigen!
